## Test Plan

- Run frontend build and backend health checks after every task.
- Add API tests for conversations, AI chat, memory, RAG, documents, and exams.
- Add UI smoke tests for sidebar, chat input, learning modes, thinking indicators, visual blocks, replay, and “Why?” expansions.
- Add RAG tests for extraction, chunking, embeddings, retrieval, trust levels, and citations.
- Add deterministic tests for graph, whiteboard, and physics visual command rendering.
- Add responsive checks for desktop, tablet, and mobile.

## Assumptions

- Implementation starts with Task 1 only.
- Each task is completed and verified before moving to the next.
- Backend remains FastAPI.
- Frontend remains React + Vite + TailwindCSS + Framer Motion.
- Ollama is the first LLM runtime.
- ChromaDB is the first vector database.
- SearxNG is the first internet search provider.
- PaddleOCR is the first OCR fallback.
- Conversation memory is scoped per conversation only, not global user memory.
